01:07:28,695 --> 01:07:34,695
An independent production distributed by United Artists, 12 Angry Men received
acclaim from critics, despite a lukewarm box-office performance.

17
01:11:41,739 --> 01:11:47,739
At the 30th Academy Awards, it was nominated for Best
Picture, Best Director and Best Screenplay.

18
